The '''Electronics Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Fabricates circuits, sensors, and Lua computers for vehicles and traps.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.ElectronicsWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Electronic</code>.

